(text "VBUS and GND go to the control board, which fuses, clamps and charges.\nThe charge LED D1 hangs from VBUS through R3; the charger's STAT pin on the control board\nsinks its cathode (J2 pin 3) while charging, so it lights only then, from the charger supply." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da9ccb2a-a5c0-516c-863a-fd304f1402c2"))
